irect observation of the owned sample was recorded at tick 69.\\\",\\\"At tick 70 a physical press trial consuming 0.1 material recorded load=0.2, held=false and flexibility=0.9 under load-band-0.\\\",\\\"At tick 71 the owned sample quantity is 0.9.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"The press trial does not establish knot formation, joining strength, durability or practical usefulness. No joining operation has been performed.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Obtain bounded physical evidence before considering a practical use of vine.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Collected an actual vine sample.\\\",\\\"Observed the sample and completed one low-intensity press trial.\\\",\\\"Reviewed the recorded load response.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Verified dated load-response record vine:load response:load-band-0.\\\",\\\"Remaining owned vine sample, quantity 0.9 at tick 71.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"An explicit accounted joining-trial interface, personal study if required, actual branch inputs, and direct joining evidence.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Request bounded recoverable joining-trial terms; review feasibility and costs before acquiring inputs or executing.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"One measured load response is now available to constrain further investigation; no practical joining benefit has been demonstrated.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"17df7989-5c77-4945-93ca-02b0f9e19d9d","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"bounded_decision","description":null,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["queries","result_json"],"properties":{"queries":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["section","search","ids","offset","part"],"properties":{"section":{"type":"string","enum":["abilities","inventory"